Value Required LOCAL_INTERFACE (\S+)
Value CHASSIS_ID (\S+)
Value Required NEIGHBOR_INTERFACE (\S+)
Value HOLDTIME (\d+)
Value NEIGHBOR_NAME (\S+)

Start
  ^Local Interface\s+Scope\s+Chassis ID\s+Port ID
  ^---------------------------------------------------------
  ^${LOCAL_INTERFACE}\s+\S+\s+${CHASSIS_ID}\s+${NEIGHBOR_INTERFACE}\s+${HOLDTIME}\s+${NEIGHBOR_NAME}\s*$$ -> Record
  ^${LOCAL_INTERFACE}\s+\S+\s+${CHASSIS_ID}\s+${NEIGHBOR_INTERFACE}\s+${HOLDTIME}\s*$$ -> Record
